{
  "duration": 50.92,
  "match": 1.0,
  "lines": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "You walk into Costco for one thing.",
      "start": 0.16,
      "end": 2.56,
      "matched": "7/7"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "The $4.99 rotisserie chicken.",
      "start": 2.68,
      "end": 5.8,
      "matched": "5/5"
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "And it's all the way at the back.",
      "start": 6.08,
      "end": 8.16,
      "matched": "8/8"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "Past the TVs.",
      "start": 8.28,
      "end": 9.52,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "Past the jewelry.",
      "start": 9.64,
      "end": 10.8,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "Past tubs of nuts the size of your head.",
      "start": 11.52,
      "end": 14.08,
      "matched": "9/9"
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "You'd think that's just where the ovens fit.",
      "start": 14.15,
      "end": 16.56,
      "matched": "8/8"
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "It isn't.",
      "start": 16.64,
      "end": 17.52,
      "matched": "2/2"
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "That chicken is cheap so you'll come in.",
      "start": 17.64,
      "end": 19.867,
      "matched": "8/8"
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "It's at the back so you'll walk past everything else.",
      "start": 19.893,
      "end": 22.88,
      "matched": "10/10"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "Costco once said it gives up thirty to forty million dollars a year to keep that price.",
      "start": 23.08,
      "end": 28.16,
      "matched": "17/17"
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "Because hardly anyone leaves with just the chicken.",
      "start": 28.24,
      "end": 31.04,
      "matched": "8/8"
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "By the time you reach it, your cart's already full.",
      "start": 31.12,
      "end": 34.1,
      "matched": "10/10"
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "The chicken was never the product.",
      "start": 34.22,
      "end": 36.187,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "It was the reason you walked to the back.",
      "start": 36.213,
      "end": 38.5,
      "matched": "9/9"
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "So if you sell anything, have one offer so good it's almost silly.",
      "start": 38.62,
      "end": 43.133,
      "matched": "13/13"
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "Then make sure they see everything else on the way to it.",
      "start": 43.2,
      "end": 46.2,
      "matched": "12/12"
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "Send this to the friend whose cheapest offer is also his only offer.",
      "start": 46.44,
      "end": 50.32,
      "matched": "13/13"
    }
  ],
